      "content": "rest doesnt really fix anything though. it just pauses the clock until the next time i mess up. i feel like i'm just prolonging something that's already broken. sometimes i look at it and think... if the cycle is what causes the pain, isn't the only way to actually stop the pain to just end the cycle entirely? to just stop everything?",
